                    <comment><![CDATA[Create an app at <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/developers/apps" target="_blank">linkedin.com/developers</a>, add the "Sign In with LinkedIn using OpenID Connect" product and add the Redirect URI above to Authorized redirect URLs (Auth tab).]]></comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="apple" translate="label" sortOrder="90" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Apple</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="client_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Services ID</label>
                    <comment>The identifier of the Services ID, e.g. ua.net.yu.signin</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="team_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Team ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="key_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Key ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="key_content" translate="label comment" type="textarea" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Private Key</label>
                    <comment>Content of the .p8 key file, including the BEGIN/END PRIVATE KEY lines. Stored encrypted.</comment>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="sort_order" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="60" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Sort Order</label>
                    <validate>validate-digits</validate>
                    <comment>Buttons with lower values appear first on the login and registration pages.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="redirect_uri" translate="label" type="label" sortOrder="70" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Redirect URI</label>
                    <frontend_model>Yu\SocialLogin\Block\Adminhtml\Config\RedirectUri</frontend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="setup_note" translate="label comment" type="label" sortOrder="80" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>How to Get Credentials</label>
                    <comment><![CDATA[Requires a paid Apple Developer account. In <a href="https://developer.apple.com/account/resources/identifiers/list/serviceId" target="_blank">Apple Developer &rarr; Identifiers</a> create a Services ID and a key with "Sign in with Apple" enabled; add the Redirect URI above as the Return URL.]]></comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="microsoft" translate="label comment" sortOrder="100" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Microsoft</label>
                <comment>The client secret has an expiry date — set a reminder to rotate it.</comment>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
